@Host = http://localhost:8006
@SellerId = aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa
@InternalKey = eaT0Ombups70WJzd85CBBpp8rAno55SxKn1qvYBGH9e

### 1. Health Probe
GET {{Host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Danh sách kho hàng hoạt động (Phân trang)
GET {{Host}}/api/v1/warehouses?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### 3. Đăng ký kho cho Seller (Lần 1: Thành công 201 Created)
POST {{Host}}/api/v1/warehouses
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: {{SellerId}}
x-user-roles: seller

{
  "code": "WH_SELLER_HN",
  "name": "Kho Ha Noi Official",
  "type": "SellerWarehouse",
  "address": "123 Xuan Thuy, Cau Giay, Ha Noi"
}

### 4. Đăng ký kho tiếp cho cùng Seller (Lần 2: Chặn lỗi 400 - Đảm bảo luật 1 Seller = 1 Kho)
POST {{Host}}/api/v1/warehouses
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: {{SellerId}}
x-user-roles: seller

{
  "code": "WH_SELLER_SG",
  "name": "Kho Sai Gon",
  "type": "SellerWarehouse",
  "address": "456 Nguyen Hue, Quan 1, TP HCM"
}

### 5. Seller tự tra cứu kho của mình (/me)
GET {{Host}}/api/v1/warehouses/me
Accept: application/json
x-user-id: {{SellerId}}
x-user-roles: seller

### 6. UserService gọi nội bộ để tự động tạo kho khi duyệt Shop
POST {{Host}}/api/v1/internal/warehouses
Content-Type: application/json
X-Internal-Service-Key: {{InternalKey}}

{
  "seller_id": "bbbbbbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb",
  "user_id": "cccccccc-cccc-cccc-cccc-cccccccccccc",
  "shop_name": "Shop Thoi Trang Tech",
  "contact_name": "Nguyen Van B",
  "contact_phone": "0912345678",
  "pickup_address": "789 Le Duan, Quan Hoan Kiem, Ha Noi",
  "province_id": 201,
  "district_id": 1490,
  "ward_code": "1A0807"
}
